          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
  children {
    ordered_list {
      items {
        children {
          text {
            heading_level: 0
            text: "Screenshot the app error now: Capture the error screen (with the timestamp visible) and your call log if you tried reaching the desk."
            annotated_ranges {
              start: 0
              end: 29
              text_annotation {
                style {
                  type: BOLD
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
      items {
        children {
          text {
            heading_level: 0
            text: "Call President's Club / 1-800-230-4898 tonight: Have the agent add a timestamped note to your agreement stating that traffic delayed your return, the Avis app errored out when you tried to extend, and the Hoboken branch has no after-hours drop box. That note protects you from the unnotified-late penalty and backs up your waiver request."
            annotated_ranges {
              start: 0
              end: 47
              text_annotation {
                style {
                  type: BOLD
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
      items {
        children {
          text {
            heading_level: 0
            text: "Ask the Hoboken counter manager at 8:00 AM: Politely explain the traffic delay, show the app error screenshot, and ask if they can close out the contract at the original return time (or waive the extra-day charge) as a President's Club courtesy."
            annotated_ranges {
              start: 0
              end: 43
              text_annotation {
                style {
                  type: BOLD
                }
              }
            }
            annotated_ranges {
              start: 219
              end: 244
              text_annotation {
                style {
                  type: BOLD
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
      items {
        children {
          text {
            heading_level: 0
            text: "Escalate post-rental if needed: If the local desk system won't let them override the extra day, call Avis Customer Service at 1-800-352-7900 (or your dedicated President's Club line in the app) once the final receipt posts. Having the night-before call note plus app screenshots gives them clear grounds to issue a credit."
            annotated_ranges {
              start: 0
              end: 31
              text_annotation {
                style {
                  type: BOLD
                }
              }
